      "value": "@{62df013246e66844a84a8ef1|full_name} I'm not sure I understand how this feature would impede those users? If free mouse movement is already enabled by the world creator using this proposed feature, the player doesn't need to hold Tab to move the mouse outside the game window. Like, this feature would make their lives EASIER, not harder. And you can very easily just \"while holding TAB, override Udon/world settings\" regardless.",
