      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{632ad07ae29a9c44bc903920|full_name} I misinterpreted the feature request. I thought you were suggesting that creators should be able to disable it, as in remove the ability for people to hold tab to move their mouse around.\n\nBut it seems like you are actually asking for the ability to enable the Tab feature? I.E: Unlock the mouse automatically so the player can use it in game mechanics?",
